msgstr "`notify_main_thread`"

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:197
msgid ""
"A wrapper that uses anything outside this list (e.g. reaches into "
"`perry_runtime::*` types directly) is **off-contract** — its build will "
"break the next time those types change. Stay on perry-ffi."
msgstr ""
"使用此列表之外内容的 wrapper(例如直接深入 `perry_runtime::*` 类型)是**不在合"
"约内**的——下次那些类型变化时其构建就会坏掉。请坚持使用 perry-ffi。"

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:201
msgid ""
"The [`abi.md`](abi.md) page is the source of truth for what's in each "
"surface. The semver promise: **breaking changes to anything documented there "
"bump perry-ffi major**, regardless of what `perry-runtime` does internally."
msgstr ""
"[`abi.md`](abi.md) 页是各表层中具体内容的事实来源。semver 承诺:**对该处所记录"
"任何内容的破坏性变更都会让 perry-ffi major 版本递增**,与 `perry-runtime` 内部"
"如何变化无关。"

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:206
msgid "Code organization"
msgstr "代码组织"

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:231
msgid ""
"The split between **well-known** in-tree wrappers and **external** is a "
"packaging convention, not a technical distinction. Both depend only on perry-"
"ffi; both ship `extern \"C\"` symbols Perry's codegen calls. The policy "
"difference is intentional: an in-tree wrapper needs a shared runtime reason "
"to remain in core. Ordinary source packages should migrate to "
"`compilePackages`, while domain-specific native integrations should migrate "
"to external packages with independent releases."
msgstr ""
"两者之间的分歧 **众所周知的** 在树上包装, **外部** 是一种包装规范,而不是技术"
"上的区别. 两者都只依赖于perry-ffi;两者都运输`extern \"C\"`符号,Perry的代码调"
"用. 政策差异是故意的:树内包装需要一个共享的运行时间理由,才能保持核心. 通常的"
"源包应迁移到 `compilePackages`,而域特定的原生集成应迁移到具有独立版本的外部"
"包."

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:239
msgid ""
"The two existing external native wrappers (`tursodb`, `iroh`) cover "
"functionality that doesn't have an in-tree perry-stdlib equivalent — they're "
"net-new bindings that originated as third-party packages. That validates the "
"contract: perry-ffi is sufficient to write a real wrapper without forking "
"Perry."
msgstr ""
"现有的两个外部原生 wrapper(`tursodb`、`iroh`)覆盖了在树内 perry-stdlib 中没有"
"等价物的功能——它们是源自第三方包的全新绑定。这印证了合约的有效性:perry-ffi 足"
"以在不 fork Perry 的前提下编写一个真正的 wrapper。"

#: src/native-libraries/overview.md:245
msgid "Three paths to a database driver (postgres / mysql / mongodb / redis)"
msgstr "三种数据库驱动的使用方式（postgres / mysql / mongodb / redis）"

