#: src/native-libraries/abi.md:1
msgid "`perry-ffi` — the stable ABI for native bindings"
msgstr "`perry-ffi` —— 原生绑定的稳定 ABI"

#: src/native-libraries/abi.md:3
msgid ""
"This page documents the contract between native bindings packages (`@perryts/"
"iroh`, `@perryts/tursodb`, `perry-ext-dotenv`, …) and the Perry runtime they "
"execute inside."
msgstr ""
"本页文档化了原生绑定包（`@perryts/iroh`、`@perryts/tursodb`、`perry-ext-"
"dotenv` 等）与它们运行其中的 Perry 运行时之间的契约。"

#: src/native-libraries/abi.md:7
msgid ""
"**New here?** Start with [Native Bindings — Overview](overview.md) for the "
"architectural picture and the [Authoring Guide](authoring-guide.md) for the "
"step-by-step. This page is reference-grade detail."
msgstr ""
"**初次接触？** 请先阅读 [Native Bindings — Overview](overview.md) 了解整体架"
"构图景，再阅读 [Authoring Guide](authoring-guide.md) 获取分步指南。本页是参考"
"级细节。"

#: src/native-libraries/abi.md:12
msgid ""
"`perry-ffi` is deliberately smaller and more stable than `perry-runtime`. It "
"owns the public ABI types and helpers that wrapper crates use while leaving "
"runtime internals—field offsets, allocator hooks, and NaN-boxing "
"implementation details—free to change."
msgstr ""
"`perry-ffi`是比`perry-runtime`更小,更稳定的. 它拥有包装盒使用的公共ABI类型和"
"辅助器,同时将运行时内部场偏移,分配和NaN-boxing实现细节自由更改."

#: src/native-libraries/abi.md:17
msgid "Versioning and dependency setup"
msgstr "版本管理和依赖设置"

#: src/native-libraries/abi.md:19
msgid ""
"`perry-ffi` ships its own semver, currently tracking Perry's minor: the "
"`0.5.x` ABI accompanies Perry `0.5.x`. The crate is not currently available "
"from crates.io: publication is blocked on publishing its optional `perry-"
"runtime` dependency and that dependency's workspace chain first. External "
"wrappers therefore use the repository dependency emitted by `perry native "
"init`:"
msgstr ""
"`perry-ffi`发行了自己的SEMVER,目前跟踪Perry的未成年人:`0.5.x` ABI伴随Perry "
"`0.5.x`. 该盒目前无法从 crates.io 中获取:在首次发布其可选的 `perry-runtime` "
"依赖关系和依赖关系的工作空间链时,发布被阻止. 因此,外部包装使用`perry native "
"init`发出的存储器依赖:"

#: src/native-libraries/abi.md:31
msgid ""
"For a released wrapper, pin a tested Perry tag or commit instead of allowing "
"an unreviewed `main` update to change the build underneath the release."
msgstr ""
"对于发布的包装,将测试的 Perry 标签或提交贴上,而不是允许未经审查的 `main` 更新"
"更改版本下面的构建."

#: src/native-libraries/abi.md:34
msgid ""
"The crate defines its own `#[repr(C)]` ABI types, including `StringHeader`, "
"`ArrayHeader`, `ObjectHeader`, `BigIntHeader`, `BufferHeader`, "
"`ClosureHeader`, `Promise`, and `NativeAsyncCompletion`. Do not import those "
"types from `perry-runtime`."
msgstr ""
"该盒定义了自己的 `#[repr(C)]` ABI 类型,包括 `StringHeader`, `ArrayHeader`, "
"`ObjectHeader`, `BigIntHeader`, `BufferHeader`, `ClosureHeader`, `Promise` "
"和 `NativeAsyncCompletion`. 不要从 `perry-runtime` 中导入这些类型."

#: src/native-libraries/abi.md:40
msgid ""
"The optional `runtime-link` feature is for wrapper tests that need the Perry "
"runtime's symbol implementations in their test binary. External wrappers "
"should normally leave it disabled: Perry links the runtime archive when it "
"builds the final application."
msgstr ""
"可选的 `runtime-link` 功能是用于需要 Perry 运行时符号实现在测试二进制中的包装"
