"record."
msgstr ""
"任何在本页面上没有记录的东西 (自定义密钥,未记录的`returns`值) **没有支持** 并"
"且可能会在释放之间断裂. 打开一个 [新的Perry问题](https://github.com/PerryTS/"
"perry/issues/new) 添加; 关闭 [\\#466](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/"
"issues/466) 仍然是 v1 设计记录."

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:1
msgid "Well-known binding upstream pins"
msgstr "众所周知的上游绑定引脚"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:3
msgid ""
"Every third-party npm package that ships a bundled native wrapper in `crates/"
"perry/well_known_bindings.toml` carries a **provenance pin**: the exact "
"upstream release the wrapper ports, its tarball content hash, and the date "
"the wrapper was last reviewed against it. This is the same discipline the "
"socket-registry fleet applies to its vendored upstream references, adapted "
"for npm dists."
msgstr ""
"每个第三方 npm 包装包装在 `crates/perry/well_known_bindings.toml` 带有 **来源"
"标签**: 具体的上游放出包装端口,其tarball含量哈希,和最后一次对包装进行检查的日"
"期. 这也是套路注册机组适用于其上游引用的同样的纪律,适用于npm分发."

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:10
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[bindings.ioredis]\n"
"crate = \"perry-ext-ioredis\"\n"
"lib = \"perry_ext_ioredis\"\n"
"tracking = \"#466\"\n"
"\n"
"[bindings.ioredis.upstream]\n"
"version   = \"5.11.1\"          # pinned npm release (immutable dist)\n"
"sha256    = \"56b4e71e…\"       # sha256 of the registry tarball at pin "
"time\n"
"repo      = \"https://github.com/luin/ioredis\"\n"
"ref       = \"fb224a76…\"       # publisher's gitHead for the release, when "
"known\n"
"ported-at = \"5.11.1\"          # release the wrapper was last REVIEWED "
"against\n"
"date      = \"2026-07-30\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"[bindings.ioredis]\n"
"crate = \"perry-ext-ioredis\"\n"
"lib = \"perry_ext_ioredis\"\n"
"tracking = \"#466\"\n"
"\n"
"[bindings.ioredis.upstream]\n"
"version   = \"5.11.1\"          # pinned npm release (immutable dist)\n"
"sha256    = \"56b4e71e…\"       # sha256 of the registry tarball at pin "
"time\n"
"repo      = \"https://github.com/luin/ioredis\"\n"
"ref       = \"fb224a76…\"       # publisher's gitHead for the release, when "
"known\n"
"ported-at = \"5.11.1\"          # release the wrapper was last REVIEWED "
"against\n"
"date      = \"2026-07-30\"\n"
"```"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:25
msgid "The lock-step rule"
msgstr "锁步规则"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:27
msgid ""
"**`ported-at` must equal `version`.** Re-pinning a binding to a newer "
"upstream release without re-reviewing the wrapper against the upstream diff "
"reds the `binding_pins.mjs --check` gate — and the perry binary itself "
"refuses to load a skewed table. An upstream release can never go silently "
"stale, and a pin bump can never outrun the review it demands: bumping "
"`version` forces you to advance `ported-at`, which forces the review."
msgstr ""
"**`ported-at`必须等于 `version`.** 如果将绑定重新固定在较新的上游版本上,而没"
"有重新检查对上游的包装,则将`binding_pins.mjs --check`门和佩里二进制器本身拒绝"
"加载偏斜表. 一个上游版本永远不会无声无声地过时,一个杆杆永远无法超过它所要求的"
"审查:撞击`version`迫使你推进`ported-at`,这迫使审查."

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:34
msgid "Exempt entries"
msgstr "免税的条目"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:36
msgid "Three kinds of row carry no pin:"
msgstr "三种排列没有:"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:38
msgid ""
"**Node builtins** (`node-builtin = true`): `zlib`, `events`, `net`, `http`, "
"`https`, `http2`, `streams`. Their upstream is Node core, not an npm dist."
msgstr ""
"**节点内置** (`node-builtin = true`): `zlib`, `events`, `net`, `http`, "
"`https`, `http2`, `streams`. 它们的上游是节点核心,而不是npm分区."

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:40
msgid ""
"**Aliases** (`alias-of = \"<binding>\"`): a package subpath (`mysql2/"
"promise`) or a bare-name alias (`fetch` → `node-fetch`) that shares its "
"target's provenance."
msgstr ""
"**别名** (`alias-of = \"<binding>\"`):一个包子子路径 (`mysql2/promise`) 或一"
"个单纯的别名 (`fetch` → `node-fetch`),其目标的来源相同."

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:43
msgid "**Perry-owned packages** (`@perryts/*`, `perry/*`)."
msgstr "**佩里拥有的包装** (`@perryts/*`, `perry/*`)."

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:45
msgid ""
"Note that a distinct npm package served by a shared wrapper crate is **not** "
"an alias — `redis` and `iovalkey` both use `perry-ext-ioredis` but are "
"separately published and versioned, so each carries its own pin."
msgstr ""
"注意一个不同的npm包由一个共享包装盒服务 **没有** `redis` 和 `iovalkey` 都使"
"用 `perry-ext-ioredis`,但它们分别发布和版本,因此每个都带有自己的 PIN."

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:49
msgid "Tooling — `scripts/binding_pins.mjs`"
msgstr "工具  `scripts/binding_pins.mjs`"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:52
msgid ""
"# Provision or bump one pin to a specific version (default: latest stable)"
msgstr "# 提供或将一个引脚放到特定版本 (默认:最新稳定)"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:54
msgid "# Provision every currently-unpinned binding at its latest stable"
msgstr "# 提供每一个目前未固定的绑定在其最新稳定"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:57
msgid ""
"# Offline gate (CI): pins present, lock-stepped, crates exist. Exit 1 on any"
msgstr "# 离线门 (CI):存在引脚,锁定,存在盒子. 任何一个路口的1号出口"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:61
msgid ""
"# Advisory: additionally flag pins whose upstream has a newer stable release"
msgstr "# 建议:在上游有较新的稳定释放的旗针"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:65
msgid ""
"# Materialize the upstream repo at the pinned ref into gitignored upstream/"
"<name>"
msgstr "# 在固定的ref中将上游repo转化为gitignored上游/<name>"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:71
msgid ""
"Never hand-edit `version` / `sha256` / `ref` — the tarball hash can't be "
"recomputed at edit time. Use `--set`, which fetches the registry tarball, "
"hashes it, records the publisher's `gitHead`, and stamps `ported-at`/`date`."
msgstr ""
"永远不要手动编辑`version` / `sha256` / `ref` 在编辑时无法重新计算tarball哈"
"希. 使用 `--set`,它会获取注册表的tarball,对其进行哈希,记录发布者的`gitHead`,"
"并盖章`ported-at`/`date`."

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:75
msgid "Cadence"
msgstr "Cadence"

#: src/native-libraries/upstream-pins.md:77
msgid ""
"The `--check` gate runs on every PR (offline). The weekly dependency-update "
"job runs `--check --refresh`, so a newly-soaked upstream release surfaces as "
"an actionable advisory — re-pin with `--set`, review the wrapper against the "
"diff (`--materialize` helps), and land the bump with `ported-at` advanced. "
"This mirrors the fleet's `vendor-actions.mts --check` weekly cadence."
msgstr ""
"在每个PR (离线) 上运行`--check`门. 每周的依赖更新工作运行`--check --refresh`,"
"因此新浸泡的上游发布表面作为可操作的建议用`--set`重新,检查对差的包装 (`--"
"materialize`有帮助),并用`ported-at`先进降落. 这反映了舰队的每周`vendor-"
"actions.mts --check`节奏."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:1
msgid "Zero-config bindings and faithfulness"
msgstr "零配置绑定和忠实性"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:3
msgid ""
"This note describes Perry's default routing for installed npm dependencies "
"and the compatibility marker used by bundled `perry-ext-*` bindings."
msgstr ""
"本说明描述了安装的 npm 依赖关系的 Perry 默认路由,以及捆绑的 `perry-ext-*` 绑"
"定所使用的兼容性标记."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:6
msgid "Resolution behavior"
msgstr "解析行为"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:8
msgid ""
"For a bare import, Perry first checks whether the module is in its native "
"module manifest. Unless the root package was explicitly selected through "
"`perry.compilePackages`, a native module is served by its bundled binding "
"and file resolution does not walk into the installed package source."
msgstr ""
"对于单纯导入,Perry首先检查该模块是否存在于其原始模块表格中. 除非根包通过"
"`perry.compilePackages`被明确选择,否则本地模块将通过其捆绑绑服务,并且文件分辨"
"率不会进入安装的包源."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:13
msgid ""
"Other reachable packages are AOT-compiled by default. When the host "
"`package.json` omits `perry.compilePackages`, Perry enumerates installed "
"packages, skips natively shimmed packages, and routes the remaining usable "
"TypeScript/JavaScript source through the compiler. Packages marked as Node "
"native addons are excluded from wildcard selection: this preserves guarded "
"optional acceleration such as `msgpackr-extract`, while a statically "
"imported pure source subpath can still be promoted into the AOT graph. "
"Reaching an actual `.node` binary still fails, and listing the addon by "
"exact name retains the actionable whole-package hard error. This is "
"equivalent to:"
msgstr ""
"其他可访问的包默认编译为AOT. 当主机`package.json`省略`perry.compilePackages`"
"时,Perry会列出已安装的包,跳过原生闪存的包,并通过编译器路由剩余可用的"
"TypeScript/JavaScript源. 标记为Node原生添加程序的包被排除在野卡选择之外:这保"
"留了防护的可选加速,如`msgpackr-extract`,而静态导入的纯源子路径仍然可以被推进"
"到AOT图中. 实现实际的`.node`二进制仍然失败了,并按确切名称列出添加程序保留可操"
"作的整个包硬错误. 这相当于:"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:26
msgid "\"auto\""
msgstr "\"自动\""

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:31
msgid ""
"`\"all\"`, `true`, and a literal `\"*\"` array entry have the same universal "
"routing meaning. An explicit package list constrains routing; `false` or "
"`[]` opts out entirely and restores the listed-only V8-free gate."
msgstr ""
"`\"all\"`,`true`,以及字面上的 `\"*\"` 阵列条目具有相同的通用路由含义. 一个明"
"确的包列表限制了路由; `false`或`[]`完全选择退出并恢复仅列出的V8免门."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:35
msgid ""
"When no allow policy is present, universal auto routing also receives the "
"universal compile allow. Explicit trust policy is never discarded:"
msgstr ""
"当没有允许策略时,通用自动路由也会获得通用编译允许. 显式的信任政策永远不会被抛"
"弃:"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:38
msgid ""
"`perry.allow.compilePackages` can constrain the packages admitted by auto "
"routing;"
msgstr "`perry.allow.compilePackages`可以通过自动路由限制被允许的数据包;"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:40
msgid "`perry.allow.compilePackages: false` or `[]` fails closed;"
msgstr "如果 `perry.allow.compilePackages: false` 或 `[]` 失败关闭;"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:41
msgid "`PERRY_ALLOW_PERRY_FEATURES=0` clears the allowlist and fails closed;"
msgstr "`PERRY_ALLOW_PERRY_FEATURES=0` 清除允许清单,未能关闭;"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:42
msgid "`PERRY_ALLOW_PERRY_FEATURES=1` remains the one-off universal override."
msgstr "`PERRY_ALLOW_PERRY_FEATURES=1`仍然是唯一的通用覆盖."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:44
msgid "The compatibility marker"
msgstr "兼容性标记"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:46
msgid "Each row in `crates/perry/well_known_bindings.toml` may declare:"
msgstr "在 `crates/perry/well_known_bindings.toml` 中每个行可以声明:"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:48
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[bindings.example]\n"
"crate = \"perry-ext-example\"\n"
"lib = \"perry_ext_example\"\n"
"compat = \"partial\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"[bindings.example]\n"
"crate = \"perry-ext-example\"\n"
"lib = \"perry_ext_example\"\n"
"compat = \"partial\"\n"
"```"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:55
msgid "The two values are:"
msgstr "这两个值是:"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:57
msgid ""
"`full`: an exhaustively audited drop-in for the pinned npm package's public "
"API and observable behavior;"
msgstr "`full`:对固定 npm 包的公共 API 和可观测行为进行了全面审计;"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:59
msgid "`partial`: a subset or a wrapper that has not yet passed that audit."
msgstr "`partial`:一个尚未通过该审计的子集或包装."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:61
msgid ""
"An absent or unknown value is `partial`. Aliases inherit the target "
"binding's effective marker; missing targets and alias cycles fail closed as "
"partial."
msgstr ""
"缺失或未知值是 `partial`. 号继承目标绑定的有效标记;缺失的标和号循环作为部分失"
"败."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:64
msgid ""
"The current third-party wrappers remain partial. Several superficially small "
"wrappers still differ materially from their pinned packages: the UUID "
"wrapper, for example, lacks exports including `parse` and `stringify`; "
"nanoid flattens a curried API and omits exports; and dotenv implements only "
"part of its current surface. A `full` marker should be added only after the "
"implementation and conformance tests cover the complete pinned surface."
msgstr ""
"目前的第三方包装仍然部分. 几种表面上很小的包装仍然与它们的固定包装有很大的区"
"别:例如 UUID 包装,缺乏包括 `parse` 和 `stringify` 在内的出口;纳米模块平坦化了"
"一个缩的 API 并省略出口;而 dotenv 仅实现其当前表面的一部分. 只有在实施和合规"
"性测试覆盖整个接表面后才应添加`full`标记."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:71
msgid ""
"Ordinary packages that have completed their source migration are not listed "
"in the native manifest or this table. They must be installed in the "
"application, and Perry compiles their package source through the normal "
"automatic routing path. `slugify` is the first completed migration under "
"this policy."
msgstr ""
"已完成源迁移的普通包在本地公示表或本表中没有列出. 它们必须安装在应用程序"
"中,Perry通过正常的自动路由路径编译它们的包源. `slugify`是本策略下的第一个完成"
"的迁移."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:76
msgid "Diagnostics and strict mode"
msgstr "诊断和严格模式"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:78
msgid ""
"When a partial binding wins while a copy of its root package exists in "
"`node_modules`, text-mode builds emit one informational note per package. "
"The note points to `perry.compilePackages`, which makes the installed "
"JavaScript source win instead."
msgstr ""
"当部分绑定在 `node_modules` 中存在其根包副本时获胜时,文本模式构建每包发出一个"
"信息注释. 这条注释指向`perry.compilePackages`,这使得安装的JavaScript源取胜."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:83
msgid "For CI that must never substitute a partial wrapper, set:"
msgstr "对于永远不能替代部分包装的CI,设置:"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:86 src/ui/layout.md:224
#: src/tui/widgets.md:59 src/platforms/watchos.md:72
#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:41 src/platforms/windows-7.md:25
#: src/container/overview.md:71 src/container/security.md:105
#: src/container/production-patterns.md:295 src/container/determinism.md:59
#: src/testing/geisterhand.md:87 src/testing/geisterhand.md:101
#: src/cli/fast-math.md:30 src/cli/dynamic-dispatch.md:123
#: src/cli/allow-js-runtime.md:67 src/cli/sandbox-buildrs.md:25
#: src/cli/sandbox-buildrs.md:53 src/cli/perry-toml.md:431
#: src/internals/gc-rooting-invariant.md:229
#: src/internals/rfc-rooting-by-construction.md:354
#: src/contributing/releasing.md:183
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:89
msgid ""
"Only enabled values (`1` or `true`, case-insensitive) activate strict mode. "
"Under strict mode Perry refuses the partial auto-preference and identifies "
"the binding and importing module. Add the root package to both "
"`perry.compilePackages` and the applicable allow policy to compile the real "
"source, or disable strict mode to accept the bundled subset."
msgstr ""
"只有启用值 (`1`或`true`,不敏感大写) 才能激活严格模式. 在严格模式下,Perry拒绝"
"部分自动偏好,并识别绑定和导入模块. 将根包添加到 `perry.compilePackages` 和适"
"用的允许策略编译真实源,或者禁用严格模式接受捆绑子集."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:95
msgid ""
"Registered subpaths are classified before root fallback. Thus an import such "
"as `mysql2/promise` uses that alias row and inherits `mysql2`'s "
"compatibility, while the installed-copy probe and `compilePackages` "
"suggestion correctly use the root package name `mysql2`."
msgstr ""
"已注册的子路径在根回落之前被分类. 因此,像`mysql2/promise`这样的导入使用该别名"
"行并继承了`mysql2`的兼容性,而安装后复制探测器和`compilePackages`建议正确地使"
"用根包名称`mysql2`."

#: src/native-libraries/zero-config-and-faithfulness.md:100
msgid ""
"Both `PERRY_REQUIRE_FAITHFUL_BINDINGS` and `PERRY_ALLOW_PERRY_FEATURES` are "
"included in the build-cache environment fingerprint, so changing either "
"policy cannot reuse an artifact produced under different routing rules."
msgstr ""
"`PERRY_REQUIRE_FAITHFUL_BINDINGS` 和 `PERRY_ALLOW_PERRY_FEATURES` 都包含在构"
"建缓存环境指纹中,因此更改任何策略都不能重复使用在不同的路由规则下生成的文物."

#: src/threading/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry gives you real OS threads with a one-line API. No worker setup, no "
"message ports, no structured clone overhead. Just `parallelMap`, "
"`parallelFilter`, and `spawn`."
msgstr ""
"Perry 通过一行 API 为你提供真正的操作系统线程。无需 worker 配置,无需消息端口,"
"无需结构化克隆开销。只有 `parallelMap`、`parallelFilter` 和 `spawn`。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:5
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewHeader(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const data = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]\n"
"    const records = [\n"
"        { score: 50, id: 1 },\n"
"        { score: 90, id: 2 },\n"
"        { score: 85, id: 3 },\n"
"    ]\n"
"    const threshold = 80\n"
"\n"
"    // Process a million items across all CPU cores\n"
"    const results = parallelMap(data, (item: number) => item * item)\n"
"\n"
"    // Filter a large dataset in parallel\n"
"    const valid = parallelFilter(records, (r: { score: number; id: number }) "
"=> r.score > threshold)\n"
"\n"
"    // Run expensive work in the background\n"
"    const answer = await spawn(() => {\n"
"        let acc = 0\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < 100_000; i++) acc += i\n"
"        return acc\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-header results=${results.length} valid=$"
"{valid.length} answer=${answer}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewHeader(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const data = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]\n"
"    const records = [\n"
"        { score: 50, id: 1 },\n"
"        { score: 90, id: 2 },\n"
"        { score: 85, id: 3 },\n"
"    ]\n"
"    const threshold = 80\n"
"\n"
"    // Process a million items across all CPU cores\n"
"    const results = parallelMap(data, (item: number) => item * item)\n"
"\n"
"    // Filter a large dataset in parallel\n"
"    const valid = parallelFilter(records, (r: { score: number; id: number }) "
"=> r.score > threshold)\n"
"\n"
"    // Run expensive work in the background\n"
"    const answer = await spawn(() => {\n"
"        let acc = 0\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < 100_000; i++) acc += i\n"
"        return acc\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-header results=${results.length} valid=$"
"{valid.length} answer=${answer}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/threading/overview.md:32
msgid ""
"This is something **no JavaScript runtime can do**. V8, Bun, and Deno are "
"all locked to one thread per isolate. Perry compiles to native code — there "
"are no isolates, no GIL, no structural limitations. Your code runs on real "
"OS threads with the full power of every CPU core."
msgstr ""
"这是**任何 JavaScript 运行时都做不到**的事。V8、Bun 和 Deno 都被锁定为每个 "
"isolate 一个线程。Perry 编译为原生代码——没有 isolate、没有 GIL、没有结构性限"
"制。你的代码运行在真正的操作系统线程上,能充分利用每一个 CPU 核心的全部能力。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:34
msgid "Why This Matters"
msgstr "为什么这一点很重要"

#: src/threading/overview.md:36
msgid ""
"JavaScript's single-threaded model is its biggest performance bottleneck. "
"Here's how runtimes try to work around it:"
msgstr "JavaScript 的单线程模型是其最大的性能瓶颈。各运行时是这样尝试绕开的:"

#: src/threading/overview.md:38
msgid "Runtime"
msgstr "运行时"

#: src/threading/overview.md:38
msgid "\"Multi-threading\""
msgstr "“多线程”"

#: src/threading/overview.md:38
msgid "Reality"
msgstr "实情"

#: src/threading/overview.md:40
msgid "**Node.js**"
msgstr "**Node.js**"

#: src/threading/overview.md:40 src/api/reference.md:4044
msgid "`worker_threads`"
msgstr "`worker_threads`"

#: src/threading/overview.md:40
msgid ""
"Separate V8 isolates. Data copied via structured clone. ~2MB RAM per worker. "
"Complex API."
msgstr ""
"独立的 V8 isolate。数据通过结构化克隆复制。每个 worker 约 2MB 内存。API 复"
"杂。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:41
msgid "**Deno**"
msgstr "**Deno**"

#: src/threading/overview.md:41 src/threading/overview.md:42
#: src/api/reference.md:530 src/api/reference.md:4051
msgid "`Worker`"
msgstr "`Worker`"

#: src/threading/overview.md:41
msgid "Same as Node — isolated heaps, message passing only."
msgstr "与 Node 相同——隔离的堆,只能消息传递。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:42
msgid "**Bun**"
msgstr "**Bun**"

#: src/threading/overview.md:42
msgid "Same architecture. Faster structured clone, still isolated."
msgstr "相同架构。结构化克隆更快,但仍然隔离。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:43
msgid "**Perry**"
msgstr "**Perry**"

#: src/threading/overview.md:43
msgid "`parallelMap` / `spawn`"
msgstr "`parallelMap` / `spawn`"

#: src/threading/overview.md:43
msgid ""
"Real OS threads. Lightweight (8MB stack). One-line API. Compile-time safety."
msgstr "真正的操作系统线程。轻量(8MB 栈)。一行 API。编译期安全。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:45
msgid ""
"The fundamental problem: V8 uses a garbage-collected heap that **cannot be "
"shared** between threads. Every \"worker\" is an entirely separate "
"JavaScript engine instance with its own heap, its own GC, and its own copy "
"of your data."
msgstr ""
"根本问题:V8 使用一个**无法在线程间共享**的、垃圾回收的堆。每个“worker”都是一"
"个完全独立的 JavaScript 引擎实例,有自己的堆、自己的 GC 和你数据的自有副本。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:47
msgid ""
"Perry doesn't have this limitation. It compiles TypeScript to native machine "
"code. Values are transferred between threads using zero-cost copies for "
"numbers and efficient serialization for objects — no separate engine "
"instances, no multi-megabyte overhead per thread."
msgstr ""
"Perry 没有这个限制。它把 TypeScript 编译为原生机器码。值在线程间通过零开销的"
"数字复制和高效的对象序列化进行传递——没有独立的引擎实例,每线程没有数 MB 的开"
"销。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:49
msgid "Three Primitives"
msgstr "三个原语"

#: src/threading/overview.md:51
msgid "`parallelMap` — Data-Parallel Processing"
msgstr "`parallelMap`——数据并行处理"

#: src/threading/overview.md:53
msgid ""
"Split an array across all CPU cores. Each element is processed "
"independently. Results are collected in order."
msgstr "将一个数组分摊到所有 CPU 核心。每个元素独立处理。结果按顺序收集。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:55
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewParallelMap(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const prices = [100, 200, 300, 400, 500, 600, 700, 800]\n"
"    const adjusted = parallelMap(prices, (price: number) => {\n"
"        // Heavy computation runs on a worker thread\n"
"        let result = price\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < 1000000; i++) {\n"
"            result = Math.sqrt(result * result + i)\n"
"        }\n"
"        return result\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-parallel-map len=${adjusted.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewParallelMap(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const prices = [100, 200, 300, 400, 500, 600, 700, 800]\n"
"    const adjusted = parallelMap(prices, (price: number) => {\n"
"        // Heavy computation runs on a worker thread\n"
"        let result = price\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < 1000000; i++) {\n"
"            result = Math.sqrt(result * result + i)\n"
"        }\n"
"        return result\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-parallel-map len=${adjusted.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/threading/overview.md:71 src/plugins/creating-plugins.md:37
msgid "Perry automatically:"
msgstr "Perry 自动:"

#: src/threading/overview.md:72
msgid "Detects the number of CPU cores"
msgstr "检测 CPU 核心数"

#: src/threading/overview.md:73
msgid "Splits the array into chunks (one per core)"
msgstr "将数组切分为多个块(每核一块)"

#: src/threading/overview.md:74
msgid "Spawns OS threads to process each chunk"
msgstr "启动操作系统线程处理每个块"

#: src/threading/overview.md:75
msgid "Collects results in the original order"
msgstr "按原始顺序收集结果"

#: src/threading/overview.md:76
msgid "Returns a new array"
msgstr "返回一个新数组"

#: src/threading/overview.md:78
msgid ""
"For small arrays, Perry skips threading entirely and processes inline — no "
"overhead for trivial cases."
msgstr "对小数组,Perry 完全跳过线程并就地处理——平凡场景下没有开销。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:80
msgid "`parallelFilter` — Data-Parallel Filtering"
msgstr "`parallelFilter`——数据并行过滤"

#: src/threading/overview.md:82
msgid ""
"Filter a large array across all CPU cores. Like `.filter()` but parallel:"
msgstr "在所有 CPU 核心上过滤一个大数组。类似 `.filter()`,但并行执行:"

#: src/threading/overview.md:84
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewParallelFilter(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const cutoffDate = 1_700_000_000\n"
"    const users = [\n"
"        { lastLogin: 1_710_000_000, score: 150, name: \"alice\" },\n"
"        { lastLogin: 1_690_000_000, score: 50, name: \"bob\" },\n"
"        { lastLogin: 1_720_000_000, score: 120, name: \"carol\" },\n"
"    ]\n"
"\n"
"    // Filter across all cores — order is preserved\n"
"    const active = parallelFilter(users, (user: { lastLogin: number; score: "
"number; name: string }) => {\n"
"        return user.lastLogin > cutoffDate && user.score > 100\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-parallel-filter active=${active.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewParallelFilter(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const cutoffDate = 1_700_000_000\n"
"    const users = [\n"
"        { lastLogin: 1_710_000_000, score: 150, name: \"alice\" },\n"
"        { lastLogin: 1_690_000_000, score: 50, name: \"bob\" },\n"
"        { lastLogin: 1_720_000_000, score: 120, name: \"carol\" },\n"
"    ]\n"
"\n"
"    // Filter across all cores — order is preserved\n"
"    const active = parallelFilter(users, (user: { lastLogin: number; score: "
"number; name: string }) => {\n"
"        return user.lastLogin > cutoffDate && user.score > 100\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-parallel-filter active=${active.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/threading/overview.md:102
msgid ""
"Same rules as `parallelMap`: closures cannot capture mutable variables "
"(compile-time enforced), and values are deep-copied between threads."
msgstr ""
"规则与 `parallelMap` 相同:闭包不能捕获可变变量(编译期强制),且值在线程间会被深"
"拷贝。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:104
msgid "`spawn` — Background Threads"
msgstr "`spawn`——后台线程"

#: src/threading/overview.md:106
msgid ""
"Run any computation in the background and get a Promise back. The main "
"thread continues immediately."
msgstr "在后台运行任意计算,并返回一个 Promise。主线程立即继续执行。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:108
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewSpawnBg(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    // Start heavy work in the background\n"
"    const handle = spawn(() => {\n"
"        let sum = 0\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < 100_000; i++) {\n"
"            sum += Math.sin(i)\n"
"        }\n"
"        return sum\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    // Main thread keeps running — UI stays responsive\n"
"    console.log(\"Computing...\")\n"
"\n"
"    // Get the result when you need it\n"
"    const result = await handle\n"
"    console.log(`Done: len=${typeof result}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewSpawnBg(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    // Start heavy work in the background\n"
"    const handle = spawn(() => {\n"
"        let sum = 0\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < 100_000; i++) {\n"
"            sum += Math.sin(i)\n"
"        }\n"
"        return sum\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    // Main thread keeps running — UI stays responsive\n"
"    console.log(\"Computing...\")\n"
"\n"
"    // Get the result when you need it\n"
"    const result = await handle\n"
"    console.log(`Done: len=${typeof result}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/threading/overview.md:128
msgid ""
"`spawn` returns a standard Promise. You can `await` it, pass it to "
"`Promise.all`, or chain `.then()` — it works exactly like any other async "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"`spawn` 返回标准的 Promise。你可以 `await` 它、传给 `Promise.all`,或者链式调"
"用 `.then()`——它的工作方式与任何其他异步操作完全相同。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:130
msgid "Practical Examples"
msgstr "实战示例"

#: src/threading/overview.md:132
msgid "Parallel Image Processing"
msgstr "并行图像处理"

#: src/threading/overview.md:134
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewImage(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const pixels = [\n"
"        { r: 100, g: 120, b: 140 },\n"
"        { r: 50, g: 60, b: 70 },\n"
"        { r: 200, g: 210, b: 220 },\n"
"    ]\n"
"\n"
"    // Each pixel processed on a separate core\n"
"    const processed = parallelMap(pixels, (pixel: { r: number; g: number; b: "
"number }) => {\n"
"        const r = Math.min(255, pixel.r * 1.2)\n"
"        const g = Math.min(255, pixel.g * 0.8)\n"
"        const b = Math.min(255, pixel.b * 1.1)\n"
"        return { r, g, b }\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-image processed=${processed.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewImage(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const pixels = [\n"
"        { r: 100, g: 120, b: 140 },\n"
"        { r: 50, g: 60, b: 70 },\n"
"        { r: 200, g: 210, b: 220 },\n"
"    ]\n"
"\n"
"    // Each pixel processed on a separate core\n"
"    const processed = parallelMap(pixels, (pixel: { r: number; g: number; b: "
"number }) => {\n"
"        const r = Math.min(255, pixel.r * 1.2)\n"
"        const g = Math.min(255, pixel.g * 0.8)\n"
"        const b = Math.min(255, pixel.b * 1.1)\n"
"        return { r, g, b }\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-image processed=${processed.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/threading/overview.md:154
msgid "Parallel Cryptographic Hashing"
msgstr "并行加密哈希"

#: src/threading/overview.md:156
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewCrypto(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    // Hash thousands of items across all cores\n"
"    const passwords = [\"pass1\", \"pass2\", \"pass3\"]\n"
"    const hashed = parallelMap(passwords, (password: string) => {\n"
"        // Stand-in for a real hash: deterministic FNV-1a over the bytes.\n"
"        let h = 2166136261\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < password.length; i++) {\n"
"            h ^= password.charCodeAt(i)\n"
"            h = (h * 16777619) >>> 0\n"
"        }\n"
"        return h\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-crypto hashed=${hashed.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewCrypto(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    // Hash thousands of items across all cores\n"
"    const passwords = [\"pass1\", \"pass2\", \"pass3\"]\n"
"    const hashed = parallelMap(passwords, (password: string) => {\n"
"        // Stand-in for a real hash: deterministic FNV-1a over the bytes.\n"
"        let h = 2166136261\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < password.length; i++) {\n"
"            h ^= password.charCodeAt(i)\n"
"            h = (h * 16777619) >>> 0\n"
"        }\n"
"        return h\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-crypto hashed=${hashed.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/threading/overview.md:174
msgid "Multiple Independent Computations"
msgstr "多个独立计算"

#: src/threading/overview.md:176
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewMultiple(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const dataA = [1, 2, 3]\n"
"    const dataB = [4, 5, 6]\n"
"    const dataC = [7, 8, 9]\n"
"\n"
"    // Three independent tasks run simultaneously on three OS threads\n"
"    const task1 = spawn(() => {\n"
"        let acc = 0\n"
"        for (const v of dataA) acc += v * v\n"
"        return acc\n"
"    })\n"
"    const task2 = spawn(() => {\n"
"        let acc = 0\n"
"        for (const v of dataB) acc += v * v\n"
"        return acc\n"
"    })\n"
"    const task3 = spawn(() => {\n"
"        let acc = 0\n"
"        for (const v of dataC) acc += v * v\n"
"        return acc\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    // All three run concurrently\n"
"    const [result1, result2, result3] = await Promise.all([task1, task2, "
"task3])\n"
"    console.log(`overview-multiple ${result1} ${result2} ${result3}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewMultiple(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const dataA = [1, 2, 3]\n"
"    const dataB = [4, 5, 6]\n"
"    const dataC = [7, 8, 9]\n"
"\n"
"    // Three independent tasks run simultaneously on three OS threads\n"
"    const task1 = spawn(() => {\n"
"        let acc = 0\n"
"        for (const v of dataA) acc += v * v\n"
"        return acc\n"
"    })\n"
"    const task2 = spawn(() => {\n"
"        let acc = 0\n"
"        for (const v of dataB) acc += v * v\n"
"        return acc\n"
"    })\n"
"    const task3 = spawn(() => {\n"
"        let acc = 0\n"
"        for (const v of dataC) acc += v * v\n"
"        return acc\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    // All three run concurrently\n"
"    const [result1, result2, result3] = await Promise.all([task1, task2, "
"task3])\n"
"    console.log(`overview-multiple ${result1} ${result2} ${result3}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/threading/overview.md:205
msgid "Keeping UI Responsive"
msgstr "保持 UI 响应"

#: src/threading/overview.md:207
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const responsiveButton = Button(\"Start Analysis\", async () => {\n"
"    status.set(\"Analyzing...\")\n"
"\n"
"    // Heavy computation runs on a background thread\n"
"    // UI stays responsive — user can still interact\n"
"    const value = await spawn(() => {\n"
"        let acc = 0\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < 1_000_000; i++) acc += i\n"
"        return acc\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    status.set(`Done: ${value}`)\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"const responsiveText = Text(`Status: ${status.value}`)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const responsiveButton = Button(\"Start Analysis\", async () => {\n"
"    status.set(\"Analyzing...\")\n"
"\n"
"    // Heavy computation runs on a background thread\n"
"    // UI stays responsive — user can still interact\n"
"    const value = await spawn(() => {\n"
"        let acc = 0\n"
"        for (let i = 0; i < 1_000_000; i++) acc += i\n"
"        return acc\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    status.set(`Done: ${value}`)\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"const responsiveText = Text(`Status: ${status.value}`)\n"
"```"

#: src/threading/overview.md:225
msgid "Captured Variables"
msgstr "捕获的变量"

#: src/threading/overview.md:227
msgid ""
"Closures can capture outer variables. Captured values are automatically deep-"
"copied to each worker thread:"
msgstr "闭包可以捕获外部变量。捕获的值会被自动深拷贝到每个 worker 线程:"

#: src/threading/overview.md:229
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewCaptured(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const prices = [100, 200, 300, 400]\n"
"    const taxRate = 0.08\n"
"    const discount = 0.15\n"
"\n"
"    // taxRate and discount are captured and copied to each thread\n"
"    const finalPrices = parallelMap(prices, (price: number) => {\n"
"        const discounted = price * (1 - discount)\n"
"        return discounted * (1 + taxRate)\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-captured len=${finalPrices.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewCaptured(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const prices = [100, 200, 300, 400]\n"
"    const taxRate = 0.08\n"
"    const discount = 0.15\n"
"\n"
"    // taxRate and discount are captured and copied to each thread\n"
"    const finalPrices = parallelMap(prices, (price: number) => {\n"
"        const discounted = price * (1 - discount)\n"
"        return discounted * (1 + taxRate)\n"
"    })\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-captured len=${finalPrices.length}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/threading/overview.md:245
msgid ""
"Numbers and booleans are zero-cost copies (just 64-bit values). Strings, "
"arrays, and objects are deep-copied automatically."
msgstr ""
"数字和布尔值是零开销复制(只是 64 位值)。字符串、数组和对象会被自动深拷贝。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:247
msgid "Safety"
msgstr "安全性"

#: src/threading/overview.md:249
msgid ""
"Perry enforces thread safety **at compile time**. You don't need to think "
"about race conditions, mutexes, or data corruption."
msgstr ""
"Perry **在编译期**强制线程安全。你不需要考虑竞态条件、互斥锁或数据损坏。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:251
msgid "No Shared Mutable State"
msgstr "无共享可变状态"

#: src/threading/overview.md:253
msgid ""
"Closures passed to `parallelMap` and `spawn` **cannot capture mutable "
"variables**. The compiler rejects this:"
msgstr ""
"传递给 `parallelMap` 和 `spawn` 的闭包**不能捕获可变变量**。编译器会拒绝这种"
"写法:"

#: src/threading/overview.md:255
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"// Reject example — Perry rejects this at compile time:\n"
"\n"
"let counter = 0;\n"
"\n"
"// COMPILE ERROR: Closures passed to parallelMap cannot\n"
"// capture mutable variable 'counter'\n"
"parallelMap(data, (item) => {\n"
"    counter++;  // Not allowed\n"
"    return item;\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"// Reject example — Perry rejects this at compile time:\n"
"\n"
"let counter = 0;\n"
"\n"
"// COMPILE ERROR: Closures passed to parallelMap cannot\n"
"// capture mutable variable 'counter'\n"
"parallelMap(data, (item) => {\n"
"    counter++;  // Not allowed\n"
"    return item;\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/threading/overview.md:268
msgid ""
"This eliminates data races by design. If you need to aggregate results, use "
"the return values:"
msgstr "这从设计上消除了数据竞争。如果你需要聚合结果,使用返回值:"

#: src/threading/overview.md:270
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewReduceInstead(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const data = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]\n"
"\n"
"    // Instead of mutating a shared counter, return values and reduce\n"
"    const results = parallelMap(data, (item: number) => item * item)\n"
"    const total = results.reduce((sum: number, r: number) => sum + r, 0)\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-reduce-instead total=${total}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"async function overviewReduceInstead(): Promise<void> {\n"
"    const data = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]\n"
"\n"
"    // Instead of mutating a shared counter, return values and reduce\n"
"    const results = parallelMap(data, (item: number) => item * item)\n"
"    const total = results.reduce((sum: number, r: number) => sum + r, 0)\n"
"\n"
"    console.log(`overview-reduce-instead total=${total}`)\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/threading/overview.md:282
msgid ""
"The one explicit shared-state escape hatch is `SharedArrayBuffer`: a SAB "
"captured into a `spawn` / `parallelMap` closure aliases the same physical "
"bytes across agents, and the `Atomics` API (including a real blocking "
"`Atomics.wait` / `Atomics.notify` / `Atomics.waitAsync`) operates on it for "
"cross-thread coordination. Only the `SharedArrayBuffer` itself is shared — "
"build any typed-array view over it per-agent rather than capturing the view "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"唯一明确的共享状态逃生孔是`SharedArrayBuffer`:一个被捕获到`spawn` / "
"`parallelMap`封闭中的SAB在各个代理之间伪称相同的物理字节,并且`Atomics` API "
"(包括真正的阻塞`Atomics.wait` / `Atomics.notify` / `Atomics.waitAsync`) 在它"
"上运行跨线程协调. 只有`SharedArrayBuffer`本身是共享的,而不是直接捕获视图."

#: src/threading/overview.md:289
msgid "Workers Are Synchronous"
msgstr "工人是同步的"

#: src/threading/overview.md:291
msgid ""
"The closure passed to `parallelMap`, `parallelFilter`, or `spawn` cannot be "
"`async`, contain `await` (directly or in a nested closure), or call another "
"thread primitive — the compiler rejects all three. Async machinery is pumped "
"by whichever thread runs it, so a worker doing async work would drain "
"completions and timers belonging to other threads and alias their heaps. Do "
"the async part on the main thread and `await` the `spawn` result there — the "
"standard pattern shown above is unaffected."
msgstr ""
"关闭传递到 `parallelMap`,`parallelFilter`,或 `spawn`不能是 `async`,包含 "
"`await` (直接或嵌套关闭),或调用另一个线程原始编译器拒绝所有三个. 不同步机器由"
"任何线程运行, 所以一个做异步工作的工人会耗尽属于其他线程的完成和计时器, 在主"
"线程上做异步部分,并`await` `spawn`结果,上面显示的标准模式不受影响."

#: src/threading/overview.md:299
msgid "Module-Scope Objects Stay Home"
msgstr "模块范围对象留在家中"

#: src/threading/overview.md:301
msgid ""
"Worker closures may read module-scope **primitives** (numbers, strings, "
"booleans), but not module-scope bindings that hold heap objects — object and "
"array literals, `const f = () => ...` helpers, `Map`/`Set`, class instances. "
"Module-level bindings live in process-wide slots that are read in place; "
"they do **not** go through the capture deep-copy, so the worker would alias "
"the main thread's heap. The compiler rejects such reads. Two easy fixes: "
"bind the value to a function-scope local first (`const copy = theGlobal;`) "
"so the closure captures the local and it is deep-copied, or declare module-"
"level helpers with `function name(...)` (static code — always fine to call "
"from a worker). `SharedArrayBuffer` module globals are exempt: cross-thread "
"sharing is their purpose."
msgstr ""
"工人关闭可以读取模块范围 **原始语** (数字,字符串,布尔数),但不包含堆对象对象和"
"数组字母,`const f = () => ...`助手,`Map`/`Set`,类实例的模块范围绑定. 模块级的"
"绑定存在整个过程中的插槽中, **没有** 通过捕获深度复制,所以工人将别名主线程的"
"堆. 编译器拒绝此类读取. 两个简单的解决方案:将值绑定到一个函数范围本地 "
"(`const copy = theGlobal;`),以便关闭捕获本地并进行深度复制,或者使用`function "
"name(...)` (静态代码始终可以从工人那里调用) 声明模块级辅助器. "
"`SharedArrayBuffer`模块全球是豁免的:它们的目的是跨线程共享."

#: src/threading/overview.md:313
msgid "Independent Thread Arenas"
msgstr "独立的线程 arena"

#: src/threading/overview.md:315
msgid ""
"Each worker thread has its own memory arena. Objects created on one thread "
"can never be accessed from another thread. Values cross thread boundaries "
"only through deep-copy serialization, which Perry handles automatically and "
"invisibly."
msgstr ""
"每个 worker 线程都有自己的内存 arena。一个线程上创建的对象永远不能从另一个线"
"程访问。值跨越线程边界只能通过深拷贝序列化,Perry 会自动且无感地处理。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:317
msgid ""
"File-system descriptors are also thread-affine. Numeric fds from "
"`fs.openSync` are just copied numbers in another thread, where the fd "
"registry does not know them, so fd operations fail with `EBADF`. "
"`fs.promises.FileHandle` objects cross thread boundaries as detached handles "
"with `fd === -1`. Pass file paths to `spawn`/`parallelMap` and reopen files "
"inside the worker when it needs file I/O."
msgstr ""
"文件系统描述符也具有线程亲和性。通过 `fs.openSync` 获取的数字 fd 只是被复制到"
"另一个线程的数值，而该线程的 fd 注册表并不认识它们，因此 fd 操作会以 `EBADF` "
"失败。`fs.promises.FileHandle` 对象在跨越线程边界时会变成 `fd === -1` 的已分"
"离句柄。请将文件路径传递给 `spawn`/`parallelMap`，并在 worker 需要进行文件 I/"
"O 时在其内部重新打开文件。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:325
msgid "Perry's threading model is built on three pillars:"
msgstr "Perry 的线程模型建立在三个支柱之上:"

#: src/threading/overview.md:327
msgid "**1. Native Code, Not Interpreted**"
msgstr "**1. 原生代码,而非解释执行**"

#: src/threading/overview.md:329
msgid ""
"Perry compiles TypeScript to native machine code via LLVM. There's no "
"interpreter, no VM, no isolate. A function pointer is just a function "
"pointer — it's valid on any thread."
msgstr ""
"Perry 通过 LLVM 把 TypeScript 编译为原生机器码。没有解释器、没有 VM、没有 "
"isolate。函数指针就只是函数指针——在任何线程上都有效。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:331
msgid "**2. Thread-Local Memory**"
msgstr "**2. 线程局部内存**"

#: src/threading/overview.md:333
msgid ""
"Each thread gets its own memory arena (bump allocator) and garbage "
"collector. No synchronization overhead during computation. When a thread "
"finishes, its arena is freed automatically."
msgstr ""
"每个线程都拥有自己的内存 arena(bump 分配器)和垃圾回收器。计算期间没有同步开"
"销。线程结束时,其 arena 会被自动释放。"

#: src/threading/overview.md:335
msgid "**3. Serialized Transfer**"
msgstr "**3. 序列化传输**"

#: src/threading/overview.md:337
msgid ""
"Values crossing thread boundaries are serialized to a thread-safe "
"intermediate format and deserialized on the target thread. The cost depends "
"on the value type:"
msgstr ""
"跨越线程边界的值会被序列化为线程安全的中间格式,并在目标线程上反序列化。开销取"
"决于值的类型:"

