"field\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"TextField\",\n"
"    width: 400,\n"
"    height: 200,\n"
"    body: VStack(12, [\n"
"        field,\n"
"        Text(`You typed: ${text.value}`),\n"
"    ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:121
msgid ""
"`TextField(placeholder, onChange)` fires `onChange` as the user types. Pair "
"with `stateBindTextfield(state, field)` for two-way binding so programmatic "
"`state.set(…)` also updates the visible text."
msgstr ""
"`TextField(placeholder, onChange)` 在用户输入时触发 `onChange`。可与 "
"`stateBindTextfield(state, field)` 配合使用以实现双向绑定,这样以编程方式调用 "
"`state.set(…)` 也会更新可见文本。"

