msgstr "居中内容"

#: src/ui/layout.md:330
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const page = VStack(16, [Text(\"Title\"), Text(\"Subtitle\")])\n"
"stackSetAlignment(page, 9) // CenterX\n"
"```"
