msgstr "[State Management](state.md) — 借助状态实现动态 UI"

#: src/ui/styling.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry widgets accept an inline `style: { ... }` object that maps to each "
"platform's native styling APIs. The same shape works on every Widget "
"constructor — `Button`, `Text`, `Toggle`, `Slider`, `VStack`/`HStack`, and "
"friends — so cross-platform styling code stays the same regardless of target."
msgstr ""
"Perry 控件接受一个内联的 `style: { ... }` 对象,该对象会映射到各平台的原生样"
"式 API。同样的形状对每一个 Widget 构造函数都生效 —— `Button`、`Text`、"
"`Toggle`、`Slider`、`VStack`/`HStack` 及同类构造函数 —— 因此跨平台样式代码无"
"论目标平台如何都保持一致。"

#: src/ui/styling.md:9
msgid "Inline style — recommended"
msgstr "内联 style —— 推荐用法"

#: src/ui/styling.md:11
msgid ""
"Pass a `StyleProps` object as the trailing argument to any widget "
"constructor. Codegen destructures the literal at HIR time into a sequence of "
"native setter calls, so the runtime shape is the same as hand-writing the "
"imperative pattern below — but the source is much shorter:"
msgstr ""
"将 `StyleProps` 对象作为任意 widget 构造函数的尾随参数传入。代码生成在 HIR 阶"
"段会将该字面量解构为一系列原生 setter 调用,因此运行时形状与下方手写命令式模式"
"完全相同 —— 但源码要短得多:"

#: src/ui/styling.md:17
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const card = Button(\"Save\", () => {\n"
"    console.log(\"saved\")\n"
"}, {\n"
"    backgroundColor: { r: 0.231, g: 0.510, b: 0.965, a: 1.0 },\n"
"    borderColor: { r: 0.0, g: 0.0, b: 0.0, a: 0.1 },\n"
"    borderWidth: 1,\n"
"    borderRadius: 8,\n"
"    padding: 12,\n"
"    opacity: 0.95,\n"
"    shadow: {\n"
"        color: { r: 0.0, g: 0.0, b: 0.0, a: 0.25 },\n"
"        blur: 12,\n"
"        offsetX: 0,\n"
"        offsetY: 4,\n"
"    },\n"
"    tooltip: \"Save the current document\",\n"
"    enabled: true,\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const card = Button(\"Save\", () => {\n"
"    console.log(\"saved\")\n"
"}, {\n"
"    backgroundColor: { r: 0.231, g: 0.510, b: 0.965, a: 1.0 },\n"
"    borderColor: { r: 0.0, g: 0.0, b: 0.0, a: 0.1 },\n"
"    borderWidth: 1,\n"
"    borderRadius: 8,\n"
"    padding: 12,\n"
"    opacity: 0.95,\n"
"    shadow: {\n"
"        color: { r: 0.0, g: 0.0, b: 0.0, a: 0.25 },\n"
"        blur: 12,\n"
"        offsetX: 0,\n"
"        offsetY: 4,\n"
"    },\n"
"    tooltip: \"Save the current document\",\n"
"    enabled: true,\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/styling.md:38
msgid ""
"The `style` arg is optional; widgets without it look identical to calls "
"before this API existed. See [`docs/examples/ui/styling/"
"button_inline_style.ts`](../../examples/ui/styling/button_inline_style.ts) "
"for the full file."
msgstr ""
"`style` 参数是可选的;不传该参数的控件与此 API 出现之前的调用看上去毫无差别。"
"完整文件参见 [`docs/examples/ui/styling/button_inline_style.ts`](../../"
"examples/ui/styling/button_inline_style.ts)。"

