#: src/ui/multi-window.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry supports creating multiple native windows and controlling their "
"appearance and behavior. Every snippet below is excerpted from [`docs/"
"examples/ui/multi_window/snippets.ts`](../../examples/ui/multi_window/"
"snippets.ts) — CI compiles and runs it on every PR."
msgstr ""
