#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:109
msgid ""
"**Setup requirement (iOS):** Add an App Group capability in Xcode to both "
"the main app target and the widget extension target. The identifier must "
"match the `appGroup` value."
msgstr ""
"**前置要求（iOS）：**在 Xcode 中为主应用 target 和控件扩展 target 添加 App "
"Group capability。其标识符必须与 `appGroup` 值一致。"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:111
msgid "Android / Wear OS: SharedPreferences"
msgstr "Android / Wear OS：SharedPreferences"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:113
msgid ""
"On Android, shared storage maps to `SharedPreferences` with the name "
"`perry_shared`. The generated `Bridge.kt` reads values via "
"`context.getSharedPreferences(\"perry_shared\", MODE_PRIVATE)`."
msgstr ""
"在 Android 上，共享存储映射到名为 `perry_shared` 的 `SharedPreferences`。生成"
"的 `Bridge.kt` 通过 `context.getSharedPreferences(\"perry_shared\", "
"MODE_PRIVATE)` 读取值。"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:115
msgid "Reload Policies"
msgstr "刷新策略"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:117
msgid ""
"The `reloadPolicy` field controls when the system next calls your provider:"
msgstr "`reloadPolicy` 字段控制系统下一次调用你的 provider 的时机："

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:126
msgid ""
"The refresh interval is read **at compile time**: the compiler scans the "
"provider's `return` statements for a literal `reloadPolicy: { after: "
"{ minutes: N } }` (where `N` is a numeric literal; fractional values round "
"to the nearest second) and bakes the interval into the generated platform "
"code. A `reloadPolicy` computed at runtime (a variable, a function call, …) "
"cannot be read — the compiler warns and the platform default applies."
msgstr ""
"更新间隔读取 **在编译时**:编译器扫描提供商的 `return` 语句以查找字面 "
"`reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: N } }` (其中 `N` 是数字字面;分数值圆到最近"
"的秒) 并将间隔编入生成的平台代码中. 在运行时计算的 `reloadPolicy` (变量,函数"
"调用, ...) 不能读取编译器警告,并应用平台默认."

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:136
msgid "`{ after: { minutes: N } }`"
msgstr "`{ after: { minutes: N } }`"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:136
msgid ""
"Re-fetch after N minutes. Compiles to "
"`.after(Date().addingTimeInterval(N*60))` on iOS/watchOS, "
"`android:updatePeriodMillis=\"N*60000\"` on Android, and "
"`setFreshnessIntervalMillis(N*60000)` on Wear OS."
msgstr ""
"在N分钟后重新检查. 在 iOS/watchOS 上编译为 "
"`.after(Date().addingTimeInterval(N*60))`,在 Android 上编译为 "
"`android:updatePeriodMillis=\"N*60000\"`,并在 Wear OS 上编译为 "
"`setFreshnessIntervalMillis(N*60000)`."

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:137
msgid "_(omitted)_"
msgstr "_(已省略)_"

