#: src/testing/test-registration.md:33
msgid ""
"Two partial gates already existed and neither could catch the pull request "
"that needed it. `scripts/gc_repsel_matrix.sh` auto-detects unregistered "
"`test_gap_repsel_*` / `test_gap_specabi_*` files, and `gc-moving-"
"witnesses.yml` adds `test_gap_gc_*` — but both sit behind a full release "
"build of the compiler, behind a changed-paths relevance filter, and in "
"workflows that are not in branch protection's required contexts. This script "
"is the cheap half of those checks, pulled out to somewhere it can block a "
"merge, and generalised to the other three places in the tree with the same "
"shape."
msgstr ""
"两个部分门已经存在, 没有一个能抓住需要的拉动请求. `scripts/"
"gc_repsel_matrix.sh`自动检测未注册的 `test_gap_repsel_*` / "
"`test_gap_specabi_*` 文件,`gc-moving-witnesses.yml` 添加 `test_gap_gc_*` ,但"
"两者都位于编译器的完整版本构建后面,在改变路径相关性过器后面,并且在没有分支保"
"护所需环境中的工作流程中. 这种脚本是这些检查的廉价一半, 拉到某个地方它可以阻"
"止合并,"

