"`[project]` 的替代项，字段相同。便于组织清晰——当两者同时存在时，`[app]` 优先"
"于 `[project]`："

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:136
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"# These two are equivalent:\n"
"[project]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"\n"
"# or:\n"
"[app]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"# These two are equivalent:\n"
"[project]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"\n"
"# or:\n"
"[app]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"```"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:146
msgid ""
"When both exist, resolution order is: `[app]` field -> `[project]` field -> "
"default."
msgstr ""
"当两者同时存在时，解析顺序为：`[app]` 字段 -> `[project]` 字段 -> 默认值。"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:148
msgid ""
"`[app]` supports the same fields as `[project]`: `name`, `version`, "
"`build_number`, `bundle_id`, `description`, `entry`, and `icons`."
msgstr ""
"`[app]` 支持与 `[project]` 相同的字段：`name`、`version`、`build_number`、"
"`bundle_id`、`description`、`entry` 和 `icons`。"

