"key_alias = \"my-key\"\n"
"google_play_key_path = \"/Users/me/.perry/play-service-account.json\"\n"
"```"

#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:568
msgid ""
"Fields in perry.toml (project-level) override `~/.perry/config.toml` (global-"
"level). For example, `[ios].team_id` in perry.toml overrides "
"`[apple].team_id` in the global config."
msgstr ""
"perry.toml（项目级）中的字段会覆盖 `~/.perry/config.toml`（全局级）。例如，"
"perry.toml 中的 `[ios].team_id` 会覆盖全局配置中的 `[apple].team_id`。"

