"为."

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:166
msgid "Escape hatches and diagnostics"
msgstr "逃生舱口与诊断"

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:170
msgid "`PERRY_GEN_GC=0` / `off` / `false`"
msgstr "`PERRY_GEN_GC=0` / `off` / `false`"

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:170
msgid ""
"Disable generational mode; fall back to full mark-sweep (intended for "
"bisection only)."
msgstr "禁用分代模式；回退到全量标记清除（仅用于二分调试）。"

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:171
msgid "`PERRY_GC_FORCE_EVACUATE=1`"
msgstr "`PERRY_GC_FORCE_EVACUATE=1`"

#: src/internals/memory-model.md:171
msgid ""
"With generated write barriers active and policy evacuation allowed, stress-"
"copy every marked non-pinned nursery object instead of only tenured "
"survivors."
msgstr ""
"在生成的写屏障激活且策略疏散允许的情况下，对每个已标记的非固定新生代对象执行"
