"理范围内调用补充电话回调,并在关闭该范围之前将返回的令牌转换为Perry值."

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:242
msgid ""
"`napi_call_function` uses Perry's general callable dispatch, not a closure-"
"only shortcut, so proxies, bound functions, and compiled JavaScript "
"functions keep their normal semantics. `napi_new_instance` uses the general "
"construction path and arms Perry's new-target state for the duration of the "
"call."
msgstr ""
"`napi_call_function`使用 Perry 的一般可调用发送,而不是仅关闭的快捷方式,因此代"
"理,绑定函数和编译的 JavaScript 函数保持正常的语义. `napi_new_instance`使用通"
"用构建路径,并在调用期间使用 Perry 的新目标状态."

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:247
msgid ""
"`napi_define_class` allocates a synthetic class id and registers its "
"constructor and prototype in the existing class-id chain. Instance methods/"
"accessors are defined on the prototype and `napi_static` descriptors on the "
"constructor. The constructor's callback record owns the class id, and the "
"default instance is allocated and stamped before the native constructor "
"runs. If the constructor returns an object, normal JavaScript constructor "
"replacement rules apply."
msgstr ""
"`napi_define_class`分配一个合成的类ID,并在现有的类ID链中注册其构造器和原型. "
"实例 methods/accessors 在原型上定义, `napi_static` 描述符在构造器上定义. 构造"
"器的回调记录拥有类ID,并且在本地构造器运行之前,默认实例被分配和盖章. 如果构造"
"函数返回一个对象,则适用正常的 JavaScript 构造函数替换规则."

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:254
msgid ""
"The registration also populates the runtime's dynamic-parent/prototype "
"tables, so a compiled class may extend a native-defined constructor and a "
"native class may extend another native class. `napi_instanceof` delegates to "
"Perry's normal `instanceof` operation, including `Symbol.hasInstance`, "
"rather than comparing only the immediate class id. The Stage 1 gate must "
"include native base-class subclassing because this crosses the runtime's "
"historically weak dynamic-extends path."
msgstr ""
"注册还填充了运行时的 dynamic-parent/prototype 表,因此编译的类可以扩展一个本地"
"定义的构造函数,而本地类可以扩展另一个本地类. `napi_instanceof` 委托 Perry 的"
"正常 `instanceof` 操作,包括 `Symbol.hasInstance`,而不是仅比较直接的类 id. 阶"
"段1门必须包含原生基类子类,因为这跨越了运行时的历史上的弱动态扩展路径."

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:262
msgid ""
"Property descriptors preserve `napi_writable`, `napi_enumerable`, and "
"`napi_configurable`. Getter and setter records use the same native callback "
"trampoline. A descriptor specifying incompatible `value`/`method`/accessor "
"fields is rejected before any property is changed."
msgstr ""
"属性描述符保留`napi_writable`,`napi_enumerable`和`napi_configurable`. 收获者"
"和收获者使用相同的原生回调床. 在更改任何属性之前,指定不兼容的 `value`/"
"`method`/accessor 字段的描述符被拒绝."

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:267
msgid "Buffers, views, and external memory"
msgstr "缓冲区,视图和外部内存"

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:269
msgid ""
"Perry `Buffer`, typed-array, array-buffer, and data-view byte storage is "
"born tenured and does not move. A returned native data pointer therefore "
"remains stable for the lifetime required by Node-API, while the wrapper "
"itself remains an ordinary rooted handle."
msgstr ""
"Perry `Buffer`,类型式数组,数组缓冲区,数据视图字节存储是固定的,不会移动. 因此,"
"返回的原生数据指针在Node-API所要求的使用寿命内保持稳定,而包裹器本身仍然是一个"
"普通的rooted处理器."

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:274
msgid ""
"The host reuses the existing buffer/view registries for type identity, "
"backing array-buffer identity, offsets, and detach propagation. Creating an "
"external array buffer or buffer creates a zero-copy wrapper over the "
"supplied bytes and attaches its callback to `NODE_API_OBJECT_META`. A "
"detached array buffer reports zero length and null data, and all existing "
"views observe the detach. Buffer APIs reject detached storage where Node "
"does."
msgstr ""
"主机重复使用现有的 buffer/view 注册表,用于类型身份,支持数组缓冲区身份,偏移和"
"脱离传播. 创建一个外部数组缓冲区或缓冲区会在提供的字节上创建一个零副本包裹,并"
"将其回调添加到`NODE_API_OBJECT_META`. 一个分离的数组缓冲区报告零长度和零数据,"
"所有现有视图都观察到分离. 缓冲区 API 拒绝 Node 的独立存储."

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:281
msgid ""
"`napi_adjust_external_memory` updates a signed per-environment counter and "
"the collector's external-memory pressure accounting. It neither allocates an "
"equivalent Perry buffer nor silently ignores the request. Underflow clamps "
"at zero for pressure accounting while the API's returned cumulative value "
"remains the checked signed total."
msgstr ""
"`napi_adjust_external_memory`更新一个签署的环境计数器和收纳器的外部内存压力计"
"算. 它既不分配同等的 Perry 缓冲区,也不默默忽视请求. 下流在零为压力会计,而API"
"返回的累积值仍然是检查的签名总数."

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:287
msgid "Async work and threadsafe functions"
msgstr "异步工作和线程安全功能"

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:289
msgid "`napi_create_async_work` creates an explicit state machine:"
msgstr "`napi_create_async_work` 创建一个明确的状态机器:"

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:296
msgid ""
"Queueing uses `perry_ffi::spawn_blocking`. The execute callback runs on a "
"worker without access to Perry heap state. Completion is posted through the "
"existing main-thread event pump and runs inside an implicit scope. "
"Cancellation succeeds only before execution claims the work; completion "
"still runs with `napi_cancelled`. Deletion before completion marks the "
"public handle deleted but retains the internal record until neither worker "
"nor completion owns it."
msgstr ""
"排队使用`perry_ffi::spawn_blocking`. 执行回调在没有访问 Perry 堆状态的工人上"
"运行. 完成是通过现有的主线程事件发布的,并且运行在隐式范围内. 取消只有在执行要"
"求工作之前才成功;完成仍然运行`napi_cancelled`. 在完成之前删除标志着公开处理器"
"已删除,但保留内部记录,直到 neither worker nor completion拥有它."

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:303
msgid ""
"A TSFN owns a strong function reference (when a function is supplied), its "
"context, bounded or unbounded queue, thread count, ref/unref state, and "
"finalizer. Foreign threads may only call, acquire, or release it. They never "
"touch a `napi_value` or the Perry collector. `napi_call_threadsafe_function` "
"copies the opaque data pointer into the queue and notifies the main thread. "
"A blocking call waits for capacity; a blocking call from the owner thread "
"with a full bounded queue returns `napi_would_deadlock`."
msgstr ""
"一个 TSFN 拥有强函数引用 (当函数提供时),它的上下文,有界限或无界的队列,线程"
"数,ref/unref状态和终结器. 外国线程只能调用,获取或释放它. 他们从来没有碰过"
"`napi_value`或Perry收藏器. `napi_call_threadsafe_function`将不透明数据指针复"
"制到队列中,并通知主线程. 一个封锁调用等待容量;一个封锁调用从所有者线程一个全"
"边界队列返回`napi_would_deadlock`."

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:311
msgid ""
"The main-thread drain invokes `call_js_cb`, which may then use the "
"environment and supplied JavaScript callback. Abort release drains remaining "
"items by calling `call_js_cb` with null environment/function as required by "
"Node-API. The TSFN finalizer runs after the queue is empty and the thread "
"count reaches zero. A ref'd TSFN contributes to Perry's event-loop keepalive "
"count; unref removes that contribution without destroying the function."
msgstr ""
"主线程排放调用`call_js_cb`,然后可以使用环境并提供JavaScript回调. 取消释放将剩"
"余的项目通过调用`call_js_cb`与Node-API所要求的零 environment/function来排放. "
"在队列空了,线程数达到零后,TSFN终结器运行. 一个ref'd TSFN为 Perry 的事件循环保"
"持数量做出贡献; unref 删除该贡献而不会破坏功能."

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:318
msgid ""
"`napi_async_init`, `napi_make_callback`, and `napi_async_destroy` bridge to "
"the existing `async_hooks` resource/context machinery. Callback scopes are a "
"validated nesting counter around that context; mismatch returns "
"`napi_callback_scope_mismatch`."
msgstr ""
"`napi_async_init`,`napi_make_callback` 和 `napi_async_destroy` 连接到现有的 "
"`async_hooks` resource/context 机器. 回调范围是围绕该语境的验证嵌套计数器;不"
"匹配返回`napi_callback_scope_mismatch`."

#: src/internals/node-api-host.md:323
