msgid ""
"Run the two exact-SHA CI gates on that pinned branch and wait for both to "
"pass:"
msgstr "运行两个精确的SHA CI门在那个钉的分支上,等待两者都通过:"

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:64
msgid ""
"Freeze that candidate SHA. Unrelated merges to `main` after the branch is "
"cut do not invalidate successful gates and do not require another test "
"cycle. Refresh the candidate only for a release-blocking fix or a required "
"version change."
msgstr ""
"结这个候选人. 在切断分支后与`main`无关的合并不会使成功的门无效,也不需要另一个"
"测试周期. 仅更新候选程序是为了修复发布阻断或需要更改版本."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:68
msgid ""
"Then use the npm-first pipeline. npm publication happens only in GitHub "
"Actions through Trusted Publisher/OIDC. There is no `npm login`, npm account "
"session, 2FA approval, or long-lived npm token in CI or on the maintainer "
"machine. The local command uses GitHub authentication to dispatch/watch the "
"workflow and anonymous registry reads to verify the published bytes."
msgstr ""
"然后使用npm-first管道. npm发布仅发生在GitHub 通过信任 Publisher/OIDC. 操作中 "
"在CI或维护器机器上没有`npm login`,npm帐户会话,2FA批准或长期使用的npm代币. 本"
"地命令使用GitHub验证到dispatch/watch工作流和匿名注册表阅读以验证发布字节."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:74
msgid ""
"Socket is an optional pre-publish tarball scan, not an npm credential. When "
"enabled, Actions submits each of the exact nine `.tgz` files as a temporary "
"Socket full scan and evaluates the results against the `perryts` Socket "
"organization's security policy. Policy actions configured as `error` block "
"publication; `warn` findings are recorded but do not block. The same "
"tarballs that pass are then sent to npm. For the current release, omit `--"
"socket-scan`; the workflow records an explicit skipped receipt and continues."
msgstr ""
"插座是一个可选的预发布tarball扫描,而不是npm凭证. 当启用时,Actions 将每一个精"
"确的九个 `.tgz` 文件提交为临时 Socket 全扫描,并对 `perryts` Socket 组织的安全"
"策略进行评估. 设置为 `error` 块发布的策略操作; `warn` 结果被记录,但不会被封"
"锁. 然后将通过的同样的tarballs发送到npm. 对于当前版本,省略`--socket-scan`;工"
"作流记录了一个明确跳过的收据并继续."

#: src/contributing/releasing.md:82
msgid ""
"To enable the gate later, store `SOCKET_API_TOKEN` as a repository or "
"organization Actions secret with permission to create/read full scans, read "
"the organization policy, and read quota. No GitHub Environment is required. "
"The value stays only in GitHub and must never be committed or exported "
"locally:"
msgstr ""
"为了稍后启用网关,存储`SOCKET_API_TOKEN`作为存储库或组织操作秘密,并允许create/"
"read进行完整扫描,阅读组织策略和阅读配额. 没有需要GitHub环境. 值只保持在 "
"GitHub 中,绝不能在本地提交或出口:"

