#~ msgid ""
#~ "It is intentionally short. The whole point of the contract is _minimum "
#~ "surface area_ — every helper added is a forever commitment, and Perry's "
#~ "internals (string layout, NaN-boxing tags, GC) are free to change "
#~ "underneath as long as this surface holds."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "本页有意保持简短。整个契约的核心就是 _最小表面积_ —— 每个 helper 都是永久"
#~ "承诺，而 Perry 的内部实现（字符串布局、NaN 装箱标签、GC）只要不破坏此表面"
#~ "就可以自由演进。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**v0.5.x consumption (current)**: until the v0.6.0 type-source-of-truth "
#~ "refactor lands, `perry-ffi` re-exports a handful of types from `perry-"
#~ "runtime` (`StringHeader`, `ArrayHeader`, `ObjectHeader`, `BigIntHeader`, "
#~ "`BufferHeader`, `ClosureHeader`, `Promise`). That makes it un-publishable "
#~ "to crates.io as-is — `perry-runtime` is a private dep and not something "
#~ "we want on crates.io. Wrappers depend on `perry-ffi` via the git URL "
#~ "while we're in the v0.5.x cycle:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**v0.5.x 的引用方式（当前）**：在 v0.6.0 类型来源重构落地之前，`perry-"
#~ "ffi` 会从 `perry-runtime` 重新导出少量类型（`StringHeader`、"
#~ "`ArrayHeader`、`ObjectHeader`、`BigIntHeader`、`BufferHeader`、"
#~ "`ClosureHeader`、`Promise`）。这使其在当前形态下无法发布到 crates.io —— "
#~ "`perry-runtime` 是私有依赖，我们也不希望把它放到 crates.io。在 v0.5.x 周期"
#~ "内，封装通过 git URL 依赖 `perry-ffi`："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`PerryTS/tursodb-bindings` and `PerryTS/iroh-bindings` ship this shape "
#~ "and `cargo build` against the live `main` branch."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`PerryTS/tursodb-bindings` 和 `PerryTS/iroh-bindings` 都采用这种形态，并对"
#~ "实时的 `main` 分支执行 `cargo build`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**v0.6.0 plan (deferred)**: invert the type ownership so `perry-ffi` "
#~ "becomes the source of truth — it defines `#[repr(C)]` versions of the ABI "
#~ "types itself, exposes opaque pointers for `Promise` / `ClosureHeader` "
#~ "(which have private state), and `perry-runtime` imports the types from "
#~ "`perry-ffi`. At that point `perry-ffi` has zero `perry-runtime` deps and "
#~ "can publish to crates.io as `perry-ffi = \"0.6\"` — wrappers switch to "
#~ "`cargo add perry-ffi`. Tracked under [\\#466 Phase 1](https://github.com/"
#~ "PerryTS/perry/issues/466) as a v0.6.0 followup; the v0.5.x git-URL "
#~ "approach is supported and tested end-to-end in the meantime."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**v0.6.0 计划（已推迟）**：反转类型归属，使 `perry-ffi` 成为唯一权威 —— 它"
#~ "自己定义 ABI 类型的 `#[repr(C)]` 版本，对具有私有状态的 `Promise` / "
#~ "`ClosureHeader` 暴露不透明指针，由 `perry-runtime` 从 `perry-ffi` 导入这些"
