#~ msgid ""
#~ "Codegen emits, at function entry, a call to "
#~ "`js_shadow_frame_push(slot_count)` (`gc.rs:493`). This reserves a frame "
#~ "in a thread-local shadow stack. Every JS-level local variable in the "
#~ "function gets a slot, and every assignment to that local emits a paired "
#~ "`js_shadow_slot_set(idx, value)` call. On function exit, codegen emits "
#~ "`js_shadow_frame_pop`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Codegen 在函数入口处发出对 `js_shadow_frame_push(slot_count)`"
#~ "（`gc.rs:493`）的调用，在线程局部影子栈中预留一个帧。函数中每个 JS 级局部"
#~ "变量都分配一个槽，每次对该局部变量赋值都会发出配对的 "
#~ "`js_shadow_slot_set(idx, value)` 调用。函数退出时，codegen 发出 "
#~ "`js_shadow_frame_pop`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The result: at any GC safepoint, the collector can walk the shadow stack "
#~ "and see the live NaN-boxed value of every TS-level local in every active "
#~ "frame, regardless of what LLVM did with registers. This is the "
#~ "\"precise\" half of the root scan — `shadow_stack_root_scanner` "
#~ "(`gc.rs:3860`)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "结果是：在任意 GC 安全点，收集器均可遍历影子栈，查看每个活跃帧中每个 TS 级"
#~ "局部变量当前的 NaN-boxing 值，而无需关心 LLVM 如何处理寄存器。这是根扫描的"
#~ "\"精确\"部分——`shadow_stack_root_scanner`（`gc.rs:3860`）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Some values are not on the shadow stack — most importantly, anything "
#~ "currently in a CPU register or in a Rust runtime frame at the moment GC "
#~ "fires. For these, the collector scans the native stack word-by-word and, "
#~ "for each word, checks whether it looks like a pointer into one of the "
#~ "arenas. Anything that does is **conservatively pinned** for that cycle "
#~ "(`is_conservatively_pinned`, `gc.rs:3747`)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "某些值不在影子栈上——最重要的是，GC 触发时当前位于 CPU 寄存器中或 Rust 运行"
#~ "时帧中的任何值。对于这些值，收集器逐字扫描原生栈，对每个字节检查其是否看起"
#~ "来像指向某个 arena 的指针。凡是符合条件的，都会在该周期被**保守固定**"
#~ "（`is_conservatively_pinned`，`gc.rs:3747`）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Pinning means: the object isn't freed, and isn't moved (the evacuation "
#~ "pass skips it). False positives are acceptable — they just keep a dead "
#~ "object alive for one more cycle. False negatives would be catastrophic — "
#~ "they'd free a live object — and the shadow stack + scanner registration "
#~ "below ensure they don't happen for known roots."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "固定（pinning）意味着：对象不会被释放，也不会被移动（疏散阶段会跳过它）。"
#~ "假阳性是可接受的——它们只会让一个死对象多存活一个周期。假阴性则是灾难性的——"
#~ "会释放一个存活对象——下面的影子栈和扫描器注册机制确保已知根不会出现假阴性。"

#~ msgid "Perry uses two-bit aging encoded in `gc_flags` (`gc.rs:64`):"
#~ msgstr "Perry 使用编码在 `gc_flags`（`gc.rs:64`）中的两位老化标志："

#~ msgid "First minor GC an object survives: `GC_FLAG_HAS_SURVIVED` is set."
#~ msgstr "对象第一次存活过次要 GC：设置 `GC_FLAG_HAS_SURVIVED`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Second minor GC it survives: `GC_FLAG_TENURED` is set, and the object is "
#~ "logically promoted to old-gen."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "对象第二次存活过次要 GC：设置 `GC_FLAG_TENURED`，对象逻辑上晋升到老生代。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`PROMOTION_AGE = 2`. The two-bit scheme avoids needing a counter field in "
#~ "the header."
#~ msgstr "`PROMOTION_AGE = 2`。两位方案避免了在头部增加计数字段的需要。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Tenured objects initially stay physically where they are in the nursery — "
#~ "promotion is a flag flip, not a copy. A telemetry-driven **evacuation "
#~ "policy** copies tenured non-pinned objects into `OLD_ARENA` and rewrites "
#~ "all references to point at the new locations only when generated write "
#~ "barriers are active and nursery/RSS pressure plus measured movable "
#~ "candidates justify the extra work. Low-pressure cycles, cycles with no "
#~ "movable candidates, and cycles without generated write barriers skip "
#~ "evacuation and reference rewriting."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "晋升的对象最初仍物理上停留在新生代原位——晋升是标志位翻转，而非拷贝。**疏散"
#~ "策略**由遥测驱动，仅当生成的写屏障处于活跃状态，且新生代/RSS 压力以及可移"
#~ "动候选对象的数量满足条件时，才将已 tenured 的非固定对象拷贝到 `OLD_ARENA` "
#~ "并重写所有引用指向新位置。低压周期、无可移动候选对象的周期以及未生成写屏障"
#~ "的周期均跳过疏散和引用重写。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Arena block allocation** — every time a new 1 MB block is allocated for "
#~ "the nursery."
#~ msgstr "**Arena 块分配** — 每次为新生代分配新的 1 MB 块时。"

#~ msgid "**Explicit `gc()` call** from user code."
#~ msgstr "**用户代码中的显式 `gc()` 调用。**"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The next-trigger calculation steps up after each cycle but is hard-capped "
#~ "at the initial threshold (64 MB) so that a workload which frees >90% of "
#~ "the nursery on each cycle can't drift peak occupancy upward through step-"
#~ "doubling (C4b-δ-tune, v0.5.236)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "下一次触发的计算值在每个周期后递增，但硬性上限为初始阈值（64 MB），以防止"
#~ "每个周期释放 >90% 新生代的工作负载通过逐步翻倍导致峰值占用量持续上升（C4b-"
#~ "δ-tune，v0.5.236）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Idle nursery blocks observed empty for 2 GC cycles are `dealloc`'d back "
#~ "to the OS (C4b-δ, v0.5.235), so a workload's RSS shrinks once the burst "
#~ "is over."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在 2 个 GC 周期内观察到为空的闲置新生代块会通过 `dealloc` 归还给操作系统"
#~ "（C4b-δ，v0.5.235），因此工作负载在突发结束后 RSS 会缩小。"

